      "slug": "bobble-st",
      "term": "Bobble stitch",
      "definition": "Five trebles into the same stitch, all left unfinished (last draw-through held), then one final draw-through to close all five at once. Pops to one side of the fabric."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "One chain at the start of each dc row; two chains at the start of bobble rows."
    },
